# Actions of this game for the Trempel hub

The kit's actions (`dev`, builds, gates, `editor`, `view:shot` — `node_modules/@trempel/kit/hub/`)
come with the kit; here — the game's own, and overrides of any of them by id. `trempel run --list`
shows every layer.

## actions

### shots
$title: Snapshots of the screens
$icon: camera
$group: content
$input.scenes: { type: "select", options: ["all", "game", "menu"], default: "all", label: "Screens" }
$input.settle: { type: "text", default: 1, label: "Seconds after mount" }
$js: tools/hub/shots.mjs

A PNG of each screen scene (`scenes/*.tml.svg`) into `shots/`, through the kit's `view:shot`.
